<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USA Detergents lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USA Detergents lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Andrew Shore said he downgraded USA Detergents Inc to attractive from buy based on the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off three at 42-1/4.</p>
</text>
